  "description": "<div class=\"flex flex-grow flex-col max-w-full\">\r\n<div data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"b286cef9-5534-4733-9fcf-d85c99ccd986\" dir=\"auto\" class=\"min-h-[20px] text-message flex flex-col items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-words [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-5 juice:w-full juice:items-end overflow-x-auto gap-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 juice:empty:hidden juice:first:pt-[3px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose w-full break-words dark:prose-invert dark\">\r\n<h3>EFperfect Affiliate Program Overview</h3>\r\n<h4>Brand Introduction:</h4>\r\n<p>EFperfect was established on July 11, 2016, in California, USA, with a primary focus on the American market. The company boasts a comprehensive supply chain system and a professional design and sales team dedicated to providing customers with high-quality products and services.</p>\r\n<p>EFperfect primarily sells home lighting products, including crystal chandeliers, ceiling fans, pendant lights, and floor lamps. The business is mainly conducted through online third-party platforms such as Amazon, Wayfair, eBay, and our own independent website. Additionally, we support our online sales with offline warehousing and showroom experience stores.</p>\r\n<h4>Product Description:</h4>\r\n<p>EFperfect offers a wide range of home lighting solutions, including:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Crystal Chandeliers:</strong> Elegant and sophisticated lighting fixtures that add a touch of luxury to any space.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Ceiling Fans:</strong> Stylish and functional ceiling fans that provide comfort and enhance home decor.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Pendant Lights:</strong> Versatile and modern pendant lights perfect for various settings.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Floor Lamps:</strong> Contemporary floor lamps that offer both functionality and aesthetic appeal.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h4>Unique Selling Points (USPs):</h4>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><strong>Free Shipping:</strong> EFperfect offers FREE SHIPPING via FedEx/UPS in the 48 contiguous areas of the United States (not applicable to Alaska, Hawaii, and Puerto Rico).</li>\r\n<li><strong>Fast Order Processing:</strong> Typically, we process orders within 1 working day. For example, an order placed on the 3rd (US time) will be processed on the 4th, and an order placed on the 4th will be processed on the 5th. If an order is placed on the weekend, processing will be delayed by one day.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>Join our affiliate program and be part of a brand dedicated to delivering top-quality home lighting solutions with exceptional service.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
